+// Experimental API.
+// Generate the normal appearance stream of |annot| from its dictionary, the
+// way PDFium generates one to draw an annotation that has none, and make it
+// the annotation's own appearance. An appearance PDFium generates only to draw
+// an annotation is not written when the document is saved; this one is. An
+// existing normal appearance is replaced. For a text markup annotation, /Rect
+// is set to the bounds of its quad points (the appearance's bounding box).
+// Only the subtypes PDFium can generate an appearance for are supported:
+// circle, free text, highlight, ink, popup, square, squiggly, strikeout, text
